      "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><p>Hello ​<user-mention data-id=\"93525\">@licunxu</user-mention>  ,<br/><br/>Yes. STM32G474 is basically STM32G473 + an HRTIM1 timer — everything else (ADCs, DACs, comparators, op-amps, communication peripherals, Flash/RAM) is the same, and since your packages are pin-to-pin compatible, one project can serve both.<br/><br/>Br</p></div>"
